{
    "DARV.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "You big bug, heading up the Spire too? Don't rush off, take something first!",
    "DARV.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.char": "<The Insatiable picks through gems shimmering with various colors>",
    "DARV.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "Continue",
    "DARV.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-1r.ancient": "You like shiny things, huh? I happen to have a fine collection right here!",
    "DARV.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "So you really are going after the Architect! Go eat him then!! That'll make our trades even better!",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "[sine]...a sandworm...of the Hive...why are you...here...?[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Continue",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "<The Insatiable sharpens its appendages>",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "[sine]...rage...good...I will...help you...[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]...your...power...is not...enough...[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "Continue",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "<The Insatiable lets out a resentful hiss>",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "Continue",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "[sine]...go...swallow...more...[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "[sine]...this...blessing...for you...[/sine]",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "Continue",
    "NEOW.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-1r.ancient": "[sine]...go...destroy...everything...he built...[/sine]",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "Visitor from the Hive, even one as savage as you has beautiful bristles. Come, I shall grant you a blessing.",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "Ornamentation is impractical for hunting, but it may help you intimidate your foes. Take this gift.",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.char": "<The Insatiable shakes the sand from its body>",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "Continue",
    "NONUPEIPE.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-1r.ancient": "It seems you have learned etiquette. That is good. But keep some wildness too... for killing the Architect.",
    "OROBAS.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "A sandworm?! Such a huge mouth! So scary! Don't eat me!!",
    "OROBAS.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0.next": "Continue",
    "OROBAS.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-1.char": "<The Insatiable shakes its head>",
    "OROBAS.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-1.next": "Continue",
    "OROBAS.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-2.ancient": "Won't eat me?! I'm not tasty?! You want to eat the Architect!? Why?!",
    "OROBAS.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "You're in sand! I'm in water!! Same thing!? Not the same?!",
    "OROBAS.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "Sand is pretty? Glass is too!! Look more! Look together!!",
    "PAEL.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]The Insatiable? Why have you left your Hive? Are you hungry again...[/thinky_dots]",
    "PAEL.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.char": "<Distant tremors rise from underground>",
    "PAEL.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "Continue",
    "PAEL.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-1r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]Stop burrowing up from the ground, you are disturbing my sleep...[/thinky_dots]",
    "PAEL.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]Can sand fill your belly? If so, my flesh and blood should work just as well. Take it...[/thinky_dots]",
    "TANX.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "[b]The Insatiable! Are your appendages still sharp!?[/b]",
    "TANX.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "[b]King of the Hive! How do you wield your weapons!?[/b]",
    "TANX.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "[b]The Insatiable, fight me!![/b]",
    "TANX.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "Fight",
    "TANX.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "<The Insatiable opens its massive jaws>",
    "TANX.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "After the battle",
    "TANX.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "[b]What a mighty beast!![/b]",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "Oh my, today's visitor is a [jitter][b]sandworm[/b][/jitter]! Come, have something to eat!",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "Are you hungry? I just happen to have some freshly baked cookies.",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "Continue",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "<The Insatiable gulps them down in great mouthfuls>",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.char": "<The Insatiable stares intently at Tezcatara's cane>",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "Continue",
    "TEZCATARA.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-1r.ancient": "Oh my, you like this? A little bug that [jitter][b]doesn't fear fire[/b][/jitter] — that's a first for me.",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0.ancient": "Even a lowly insect wants to make a deal? Very well. I am [sine]insatiable[/sine] like you.",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.ancient": "Sign the contract here, yes, with those claws of yours—",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "Swallow",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-1r.char": "<The Insatiable swallows the parchment whole>",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-1r.next": "Continue",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-2r.ancient": "Well, that works too.",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.ancient": "Have you ever tasted a [sine]soul[/sine]?",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "Respond",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-1r.char": "<The Insatiable waves its mandibles>",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-1r.next": "Continue",
    "VAKUU.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-2r.ancient": "Excellent! Then take a look at this [sine]contract[/sine]!",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0r.ancient": "Why has a sandworm from the Hive come to the top of the Spire?",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-0r.next": "Respond",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-1r.char": "<The Insatiable brandishes its appendages>",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-1r.next": "Continue",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-2r.ancient": "Crude beast.",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.0-attack": "Both",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.char": "<The Insatiable charges toward the Architect>",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-0r.next": "Continue",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-1r.ancient": "You insect. Don't you know when to retreat?",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.1-attack": "Both",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.char": "<The Insatiable erupts from the sand>",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-0r.next": "Taunt",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-1r.ancient": "You again, wretched creature.",
    "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.THE_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER_INSATIABLE_CHARACTER.2-attack": "Both"
}